<p>You chant the glory of the Sun, empowering your light and fire elemental attacks so that they do <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58%</acronym> additional damage.</p><p>In addition, this talent surrounds you with a shield of light, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">14, 19, 23, 26, 28</acronym> light damage to anything that hits you in melee.</p><p>Your lite radius is also increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6.</acronym></p><p>You may only have one Chant active at once and this Chant costs less power to sustain.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Spellpower.</p>